  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pad see ew relies on a very hot wok to develop "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wok hei ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wok-hei"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The noodles need to sit undisturbed for a few seconds at a time so they can colour and char slightly. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Oyster sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "oyster-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and light soy sauce do the seasoning. Keep the sauce quantities measured before you start as the cooking goes fast."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
